p.src:
Now take a mixed tensor $T^m{}_n$. Its transformed trace is $\begin{aligned}
 T'^m{}_m
 &=
 \frac{\partial y^m}{\partial x^a}
 \frac{\partial x^b}{\partial y^m}
 T^a{}_b \notag\\
 &=\delta^b{}_aT^a{}_b
 =T^a{}_a.
\end{aligned}$ The contracted quantity has no free index and is therefore a scalar.

